  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-24T12:24:10.810Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello! Can we have the native camera working as a streamer camera in desktop mode? My suggestion is to implement a virtual webcam driver that outputs only the viewport from the in-game camera so we can add as a regular camera in OBS for video recording with no UI and a clean 1080p60 video feed. I truly believe that VRC could be a great content creation tool but it still lacks of better feature like this. Doing it so from inside VR is just not the best option, we need to to it from the desktop mode. There are so many content that can be created from this game, a great opportunity is being wasted here, unfortunately. Thanks!",
